      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EHow to make Tartes of Spinage.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nBoyle your Spinage very tender, and three or foure apples with it, and when it is very tender, straine it through a faire cloth, and then season it with the yolk of an egge, Sugar, Sinamon, and Ginger. Tartes of Borage after the same fashion.\u003Cbr\u003E"
